2. Memory footprint at `Create()` time: The layer now logs `resident_routed_expert_bytes`, `resident_shared_expert_bytes`, `resident_total_expert_bytes`, and `resident_total_expert_mib` under `NEMOTRON_FORWARD_DEBUG` at [expert_layer.cpp](/home/khkramer/src/nemotron-inference/runtime/src/backend/expert_layer.cpp#L950). I did not run a full model construction in this checkpoint, so I don’t have a fresh emitted runtime value, but the expected Nano footprint remains the plan’s ~`799,605,760` bytes per expert layer and ~`17.1 GB` across `23` expert layers.

